    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a merchant who've just managed to land a good deal for a building on the side of main road to the City of Poslor, right before the city's wall. This purchase however gives quite a heavy blow to your chest fund, but the potential profit is unimaginable. With little left on your pocket you decided to open a restaurant, food business is well known to have a good profit margin after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Source ingredients by knowing locals around you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >who knows, after getting on their good side, they might give you special discount or sell item they don't put on display</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook and sell your food</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you are what you eat, your customers are mostly adventurers and their stat growth will be affected by your food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join on quests!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >good food brings up troop's morale, with enough reputation you can apply to join as army's field cook.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a merchant who've just managed to land a good deal for a building on the side of main road to the City of Poslor, right before the city's wall. This purchase however gives quite a heavy blow to your chest fund, but the potential profit is unimaginable. With little left on your pocket you decided to open a restaurant, food business is well known to have a good profit margin after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Source ingredients by knowing locals around you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >who knows, after getting on their good side, they might give you special discount or sell item they don't put on display</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook and sell your food</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you are what you eat, your customers are mostly adventurers and their stat growth will be affected by your food.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join on quests!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >good food brings up troop's morale, with enough reputation you can apply to join as army's field cook.</p>",
